        "label": "Das Diagramm aus der vorigen Aufgabe",
        "markdown": "![Säulendiagramm: Stadt A 78, Stadt B 80, Stadt C 82 Punkte. Die y-Achse beginnt bei 77.](data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20620%20310%22%20width%3D%22440%22%20height%3D%22220%22%20font-family%3D%22sans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2216%22%3E%0A%3Crect%20width%3D%22620%22%20height%3D%22310%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffffff%22/%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%22310%22%20y%3D%2228%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20font-size%3D%2218%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%3EZufriedenheit%20in%20drei%20St%C3%A4dten%3C/text%3E%0A%3Cg%20stroke%3D%22%23bbbbbb%22%20stroke-dasharray%3D%224%204%22%3E%0A%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%22250%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%22250%22/%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%22210%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%22210%22/%3E%0A%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%22170%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%22170%22/%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%22130%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%22130%22/%3E%0A%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%2290%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%2290%22/%3E%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%2250%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%2250%22/%3E%0A%3C/g%3E%0A%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%2240%22%20x2%3D%22120%22%20y2%3D%22250%22%20stroke%3D%22%23000000%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22/%3E%0A%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%22250%22%20x2%3D%22560%22%20y2%3D%22250%22%20stroke%3D%22%23000000%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22/%3E%0A%3Cg%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%22256%22%3E77%3C/text%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%22216%22%3E78%3C/text%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%22176%22%3E79%3C/text%3E%0A%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%22136%22%3E80%3C/text%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%2296%22%3E81%3C/text%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22110%22%20y%3D%2256%22%3E82%3C/text%3E%0A%3C/g%3E%0A%3Crect%20x%3D%22160%22%20y%3D%22210%22%20width%3D%2280%22%20height%3D%2240%22%20fill%3D%22%2323373b%22/%3E%0A%3Crect%20x%3D%22300%22%20y%3D%22130%22%20width%3D%2280%22%20height%3D%22120%22%20fill%3D%22%2323373b%22/%3E